07. Use of fabricated data claimed to be obtained by experimental work, or data copied or obtained by unfair means, or AI-generated fabricated citations and references;

08. Impersonating another Student at a test or an examination or allowing oneself to be impersonated;


09. Contract cheating, e.g., employing or using services/tools provided by a third party in graded coursework or at a test or an examination; and/or


10. Use of fraudulent documents and/or information to gain advantage for any academic work, e.g., submission of a fraudulent medical certificate to request for a make-up examination.

